  "title": "Kirby Corporation Announces Date For 2025 Fourth Quarter Earnings Release and Earnings Webcast",
  "summary": "December 30, 2025 at 4:05 PM EST PDF Version HOUSTON, Dec. 30, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Kirby Corporation (“Kirby”) (NYSE: KEX) will announce its 2025 fourth quarter results at 6:00 a.m. Central Standard Time (“CST”) on Thursday, January 29, 2026. This announcement will be followed by an earnings conference call webcast at 7:30 a.m. CST. […]",
